        "cooked": "<p>https://greaterthangames.com/content/exemplar-of-broken-city</p><p>https://greaterthangames.com/store/sentinel-tactics-broken-city</p><p>Juding from these images and the closeup of the box, I'd say exemplar has long, untorn, patchworked pants. Shoes...hard to say. I'd say either a ratty brown dress shoe, but it's totally possible he is going barefoot as well (I could see that).</p><p>This is totally an Adam question though. Maybe if he sees this he will chime in quick.</p>",
